{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"agent_message","text":"The exploration reached the intended overlap. Node 1 stayed leader in term 2; transfer timed out at tick 10, and joint configuration remained at index 5 through tick 30 despite continued message delivery and Ready processing. A separately submitted ordinary proposal then triggered automatic exit.\n\nThat suggests a missing continuation, but does not yet prove permanent stalling. I’ll construct a fresh check that compares all behavior-relevant state across a repeatable idle interval, including timers, queues, progress, storage, and callbacks."}}
