Ready/Advance operation with no crashes or storage failure.',assumptions=['Committed entering configuration is genuinely applied before Advance.','The same eligible leader retains authority and both constituent quorums remain available.','A bounded loss of transfer-trigger traffic is allowed; all subsequent traffic is delivered and all required Ready work completes.','No further client proposal, manual leave, forced election, restart or configuration cancellation is owed by the caller solely to implement implicit automatic exit.'],excluded=['No numeric completion deadline is asserted.','No claim that a finite non-completion window alone violates eventual progress.','No deployment-specific persistence failure, application business-state semantics, async-storage variant or global consensus safety verdict.']),pending=[],grounding=dict(source_ids=['M-conf-contract','M-auto-contract','M-auto','M-api','M-advance'],binding_ids=bindids,derivation='ConfChangeTransitionJointImplicit promises automatic exit by proposing a zero change; Config.AutoLeave says Raft carries it out when possible. appliedTo explicitly recognizes transfer rejection and assigns retry to later advance. Once entering configuration was committed/applied, this is library continuation rather than a caller retry of an uncommitted client proposal. A closed fair suffix that keeps eligible AutoLeave pending refutes continuation without inventing a deadline.',applicability='Applied AutoLeave joint config, leader remains an incoming voter, caught-up joint voters and completed caller work; no permanent transport loss.',alternatives=['Later applied client work or a new leader/no-op can provide a retry, but these are extra stimuli outside this automatic idle continuation obligation.'],unresolved=[],conflicts=[]))\ndef binding(i,m,s,a,b,desc):return dict(id=i,material_id=m,symbol=s,start_line=a,end_line=b,description=desc,pending=[],associations=[dict(claim_id=claimid,source_ids=[m],rationale=desc)])\nbindings=[binding(bindids[0],'M-auto','raft.appliedTo',740,767,'Consumes active AutoLeave configuration and acknowledged application; proposes empty configuration through ordinary Step and can be rejected during transfer.'),binding(bindids[1],'M-election','raft.tickHeartbeat',862,889,'Clears failed leadership transfer at electionTimeout while continuing leader heartbeats; inspect whether clearing enables retry.'),binding(bindids[2],'M-advance','RawNode.Advance',482,494,'Executes only steps captured for this Ready; empty heartbeat Ready does not itself produce an application acknowledgment.')]\ndef eq(f,v):return dict(field=f,op='eq',value=v)\nlegality=dict(source_ids=['M-bootstrap','M-raw-api','M-ready-contract','M-api','M-send','M-transfer','M-election','M-apply-response','M-advance','M-conf-contract','M-state-fields','M-memory-fields'],binding_ids=bindids,derivation='Three real RawNodes bootstrap identical voters and elect node 1 via actual vote traffic. Every Ready persists entries/HardState, applies committed configuration and then Advances; all messages arise from target output and are delivered in one FIFO queue. TransferLeader interleaves only after leader ApplyConfChange of the entering joint record and before Advance, preserving the suspected overlap. The sole loss policy drops TimeoutNow in a bounded prefix; after tick 10 every generated message is delivered. From ticks 20 to 30 the repeatable policy is Tick each node once then fully drain all Ready and traffic. No target fields or dependencies are replaced. The read-only projection traverses each RawNode including raft, log, MemoryStorage, progress/inflight buffers, term/roles, timers, pending queues, stepsOnAdvance and function code identities. It excludes only diagnostic logger fields, MemoryStorage call counters and its unlocked mutex. Every API call is serialized; there are no spawned workers or pending cleanup. A separately marked rescue proposal occurs after the primary result and is not evidence of autonomous continuation.',applicability='Normal Ready/Advance; completed in-memory writes model durable success in a run without crashes; actual configuration effects are applied by the driver.',unresolved=['Current semantic review must verify the state projection and source-based exclusion of entropy: only heartbeat traffic and stable roles in this suffix mean resetRandomizedElectionTimeout is not called.'],alternatives=[],conflicts=[])\nprop=dict(checker_id='CK-no-idle-cycle',kind='event_assertion',trigger=eq('event','cycle_result'),assertion=eq('forbidden_idle_cycle',False),identity_fields=['operation_id'],description='No fully observed closed, drained, role-stable heartbeat/tick cycle may leave the admitted automatic exit pending after transfer clears. forbidden_idle_cycle is computed from exact structural equality of two live-state projections, drained queues/Ready work, only-heartbeat traffic, stable roles, no new application batches, pending AutoLeave and unchanged applied/committed/log tail. Failure is a finite cycle witness with source-based repeatability; false only means this specific witness was not found, not universal eventual completion.')\nmon=dict(id='MON-idle-cycle',checker_id=prop['checker_id'],event='cycle_result',binding_ids=bindids,admission_alias='admitted',applicability_conditions=[eq('scenario','failed_transfer_idle')],grounding=dict(source_ids=['M-auto','M-conf-contract','M-auto-contract','M-election','M-transfer-abort','M-apply-response','M-advance','M-state-fields','M-memory-fields','M-random','M-progress-fields','M-inflight-fields'],binding_ids=bindids,derivation='Correlate result to one admitted configuration operation using operation_id; config_index is retained in the prerequisite and result and represents the observed committed entering record. The predicate excludes a fair closed idle cycle, not absence before a made-up deadline. State equality and the source of the periodic transition establish repeatability; no unrelated operation completion is assumed.',applicability='Only declared failed_transfer_idle scenario; rescue output is diagnostic.',unresolved=['Correspondence review of exact projection and periodic suffix is required.'],conflicts=[],alternatives=['A nonrepeating endpoint is not by itself a positive liveness proof.']))\nplan=dict(description='Fresh direct check of C-auto-leave-continuation, based on the explored real-node history. Start transfer between joint configuration application and its Advance; after bounded TimeoutNow loss and timeout, compare complete behavioral projections at the same phase of two successive ten-tick heartbeat cycles. Retain both projections and raw counters. Later unrelated proposal is a distinct rescue diagnostic.',claim_id=claimid,binding_ids=bindids,harness=dict(kind='go_test',source='',files={},description='Serialized three-node RawNode driver with actual Ready persistence/application and actual peer traffic; read-only recursive state observer and explicit post-result rescue.',semantic_changes=['No target code or protocol state mutations outside public API and required Storage writes.','Adds only read-only observation and a bounded transport loss policy for TimeoutNow.'],prerequisites=[dict(alias='admitted',event='admitted',conditions=[eq('scenario','failed_transfer_idle'),eq('triggered',True),eq('transferee',2),eq('dropped_timeout_now',1),eq('role','StateLeader'),eq('drained',True),eq('all_applied_config',True)])],legality=legality),monitors=[mon],observable_properties=[prop],uncertainties=['The reflection observer intentionally excludes logger, unlocked mutex and call-count diagnostics; review must verify these are behaviorally inert for the captured serialized suffix.','Entropy is not compared globally; the observed stable-role heartbeat-only suffix must be shown not to consume election randomness.','This property finds a closed counterexample cycle; a false result would not prove the general eventual-progress obligation.'])\nfeedback=dict(ref_ids=[cid,'c9ed902712d346bb8321e3b863234579','M-auto','M-conf-contract','M-apply-response','M-advance'],answered='Exploration c9ed902712d346bb8321e3b863234579 completed with exit 0. The entering config at index 5 was applied/acknowledged with node 1 leader in term 2 and transferee 2. Exactly one TimeoutNow was dropped. At tick 10 transferee cleared; through ticks 20 and 30 last/commit/applied stayed 5, AutoLeave and outgoing voters remained, while 120 further peer messages and 90 Ready batches were processed after the initial drain and application batches stayed at 9. The explicitly separate ordinary proposal then drove applied/commit to 7 and removed the outgoing set. This excludes a guaranteed retry from the exercised empty-Ready/tick suffix, but finite exploration alone is not a liveness finding.',remaining=['Fresh fixed execution must retain the full state projections and evaluate the no-closed-idle-cycle predicate.','Review exact history, observer exclusions, identity, periodic schedule and causal explanation before attributing a violation.'],understanding='updated',rationale='The exploration resolved legal overlap and observed the distinguishing trigger gap. A formal artifact now fixes the requirement and observable cycle predicate independently; it does not relabel exploration as evidence.',question_updates={cid:dict(unknowns=q['unknowns'],resume_conditions=[])})\nsources=[dict(id='M-state-fields',file='raft.go',start_line=341,end_line=435,kind='code_observation'),dict(id='M-memory-fields',file='storage.go',start_line=92,end_line=203,kind='code_observation'),dict(id='M-random',file='raft.go',start_line=2043,end_line=2051,kind='code_observation'),dict(id='M-progress-fields',file='tracker/progress.go',start_line=24,end_line=118,kind='code_observation'),dict(id='M-inflight-fields',file='tracker/inflights.go',start_line=20,end_line=43,kind='code_observation')]\nsub=dict(action='check',candidate=dict(action='obligation',candidate_id=cid,question=q,obligation=claim,bindings=bindings,rationale='Fix the implementation-owned automatic continuation duty under explicit healthy idle scheduling; apply current sourced Candidate without changing its scope.'),plan_path='transfer_plan.json',harness_path='transfer_formal_test.go',files={},rationale='The actual exploration reached the discriminator. Submit a fresh fixed check for a repeatable idle-cycle witness rather than converting its finite wait into a deadline claim.',sources=sources,feedback=feedback)\nfor p,x in [('transfer_plan.json',plan),('submission_check.json',sub)]:json.dump(x,open(p,'w'),indent=2)\nPY\npython3 make_check.py\npython3 - <<'PY'\nimport json,subprocess\nr=json.load(open('../research.json'));p=subprocess.run(r['validation']['command']+['submission_check.json'],capture_output=True,text=True);print(p.stdout);print(p.stderr)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
